## EU AI Act text 🇪🇺

The corpus queried by this project — Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 of the European
Parliament and of the Council (OJ L 2024/1689, 12.7.2024) — is a legislative
text of the European Union. It is **not** part of this repository: it is
downloaded at setup time by `scripts/download_data.sh` into the gitignored
`data/raw/` directory.

- Automated source (verbatim Markdown mirror used by the script):
  https://github.com/tjf-trojer/eu-ai-act-map
- Official source (authentic OJ PDF, manual download):
  https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/PDF/?uri=OJ:L_202401689

Reuse of EU public documents is permitted under Commission Decision
2011/833/EU on the reuse of Commission documents, with acknowledgement of
the source.

